{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55182","headline":"临迁化时偈（《江西诗徴》题作《诗》） · 匡仁","name":"临迁化时偈（《江西诗徴》题作《诗》）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我路碧空外，白云无处闲。\n世有无根树，黄叶送风（《景德传灯录》、《五灯会元》作「风送」，《江西诗徴》作「风吹黄叶」）还。\n（见《祖堂集》卷八、《景德传灯录》卷十七、《五灯会元》卷十三、《江西诗徴》卷八七。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"匡仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55182.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55182","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}